ENT"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Kid's Factors(TM) is a delicious-tasting smoothie mix that provides comprehensive nutritional support for kids and adults too with food sensitivities."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The formula contains essential nutrients, supplements and herbal extracts that support overall good health."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For people with dairy allergies, try the dairy free Kid's Factors(TM) Daily Nutrient Boost with pea protein."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Usage: Children 12 years and older: Mix 1 scoop of powder with 1 1/2 cups of rice or almond milk and ice cubes in a blender. Blend until smooth. Add 1 cup of frozen or fresh fruit (e.g., bananas, strawberries or blueberries).\nChildren under 12: Mix 1/2 a scoop of powder with 1/2 a cup of rice or almond milk and ice cubes in a blender. Blend until smooth. Follow mixing directions for fruit recipe as above.\nOther Directions: Water, milk or soy milk (if not allergic to dairy or soy) may be substituted for the liquid in the smoothie. Alternatives to smoothie: add to cooked cereal (add after cooking), yogurt or cold cereal. Add Kid's Factors(TM) Balanced Omega 3-6-9 Creamy Liquid for essential fatty acid support.\nTake Kid's Factors(TM) once per day. Begin with smaller serving size and increase to full amount as tolerated."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"All Natural Factors products are manufactured in accordance with the Government of Canada's Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), among the highest standards in the world."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Contains no artificial color or sweeteners; no gluten or yeast."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Sealed for your protection. Do not use if seal is broken."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PRODUCT OF CANADA"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes